# 1Password secret-reference template for the fracta environment.
#
# Copy this file to `.op-env` (which is gitignored) and add op:// references
# for the secrets your local setup needs. `op run` resolves the references
# at runtime, so the resolved file never lands on disk.
#
# Usage: op run --env-file .op-env -- <command>
# Requires: op CLI >= 2.33.0, 1Password desktop app integration enabled.
#
# Each line in your local .op-env should be of the form:
#
#   MY_VAR_NAME="op://<vault>/<item>/<field>"
